From 612e433682685344a0442aa086521c90e1555f96 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ObeseCatLord <6099645+ObeseCatLord@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 15:03:56 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] options: more frame rates, Monitor refresh rate and Custom
 (61-240); hover/keyboard-only menu selection

The option table gets an editable-number choice (stored as fps=173; fps=monitor
follows the monitor the window is on, polled twice a second). The F2 menu steps
the custom number with Left/Right (Shift: 10), the wheel, or typed digits +
Enter. Menus highlight only a hovered item or one chosen with the keys/pad.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
